> any other version other than 2.22.0) and make sure every incarnation of it
> is removed from the computer and do some file searching to make sure you
> can't find any gtk files hanging around. Then install 2.22.0 and the rest.
> At least that would be my guess.
> Hope that works.
>
> Regards,
> Graham
